  "sources": [
    {
      "title": "Trump hosts third crypto gala for meme coin amid conflict of interest outcry",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/nov/22/trump-cryptocurrency-gala-meme-coin",
      "description": "<p>Virginia dinner comes as Democrats accuse president of improperly profiting from his cryptocurrency ventures</p><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/donaldtrump\">Donald Trump</a> is scheduled to headline his third <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/technology/cryptocurrencies\">cryptocurrency</a> gala on ⁠Sunday night at his ​country club in Virginia, rewarding top holders of his own meme coin as Democrats <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/jul/01/trump-accused-one-billion-dollars-crypto-venture\">accuse</a> the president of improperly profiting from his crypto ventures.</p><p>The dinner, set to take place at the Trump National Golf Club in Sterling, Virginia, will include meet-and-greets with Trump supporters including the boxing champion Floyd Mayweather, Shark Tank investor Kevin O’Leary, NBA champion Tristan Thompson and mentalist Lior Suchard, according to the event’s <a href=\"https://gettrumpmemes.com/gala-dinner\">website</a>.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/nov/22/trump-cryptocurrency-gala-meme-coin\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-11-23T00:31:31"
    },
